  <AgeReversalDemanded.stages.terrible_aging.description>我的青春正在流失。我应该在生物雕塑舱中进行一次年龄逆转。</AgeReversalDemanded.stages.terrible_aging.description>
  <AgeReversalDemanded.stages.horrific_aging.label>骇人的衰老</AgeReversalDemanded.stages.horrific_aging.label>
  <AgeReversalDemanded.stages.horrific_aging.description>我被困在一座腐朽的血肉牢笼中！我需要在生物雕塑舱中进行一次年龄逆转。</AgeReversalDemanded.stages.horrific_aging.description>
  <AgeReversalReceived.stages.received_age_reversal.label>接受了年龄逆转</AgeReversalReceived.stages.received_age_reversal.label>
  <AgeReversalReceived.stages.received_age_reversal.description>衰老与死亡束缚不了我。我永存不朽，正如一个受强化的人类所应然。</AgeReversalReceived.stages.received_age_reversal.description>
