  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.healthy_trees.label>健康的树木</TreeDensityReduced.stages.healthy_trees.label>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.healthy_trees.description>在过去的这个季度，我们完全没破坏多少树。与树木和谐相处是美好生活的基本根基。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.healthy_trees.description>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.label>树木受扰</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.label>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.description>在过去的这个季度，我们破坏了本不该破坏的树木。这也许是必要的，但仍是值得悲伤的事。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.description>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defaced.label>树木遭毁容</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defaced.label>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defaced.description>在过去的这个季度，我们破坏了许多本不该破坏的树木。我认为这并非必要。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defaced.description>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_damaged.label>树木受损害</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_damaged.label>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_damaged.description>在过去的这个季度，我们破坏了许多本不该破坏的树木。这桩罪行并非必要，但我们还是那样做了。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_damaged.description>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_harmed.label>树木受伤害</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_harmed.label>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_harmed.description>在过去的这个季度，我们破坏了不可原谅数量的树木。我们需要做得好得多。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_harmed.description>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defiled.label>树木遭玷污</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defiled.label>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defiled.description>在过去的这个季度，我们破坏了不可原谅数量的树木。罪责沉重地压在我们身上。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_defiled.description>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_wrecked.label>树木被摧毁</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_wrecked.label>
  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_wrecked.description>在过去的这个季度，我们破坏了极大量的树木。即便现在，我仍能听见树叶的尖叫。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_wrecked.description>
