  <TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_ravaged.description>在过去的这个季度，我们破坏了骇人数量的树木。我们是这个宇宙的祸害。</TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_ravaged.description>
  <TreesDesired.stages.amazing_trees.label>令人惊叹的树木</TreesDesired.stages.amazing_trees.label>
  <TreesDesired.stages.amazing_trees.description>我身边环绕着好几棵巨大而美丽的树。自然的荣耀令我震撼！</TreesDesired.stages.amazing_trees.description>
  <TreesDesired.stages.amazing_tree-0.label>令人惊叹的树</TreesDesired.stages.amazing_tree-0.label>
  <TreesDesired.stages.amazing_tree-0.description>我刚刚遇到了一棵巨大而美丽的树——一个道德的实体所在！</TreesDesired.stages.amazing_tree-0.description>
  <TreesDesired.stages.remarkable_trees.label>非凡的树木</TreesDesired.stages.remarkable_trees.label>
